# Local development needs no environment file and uses http://localhost:3000.
# Configure production domains in Vercel project settings.
# Vercel Production: VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL supplies the production hostname.
# Vercel Preview: VERCEL_URL supplies the deployment hostname.
# SITE_URL is not used.
# Enable System Environment Variables in Vercel project settings.
# Set ENABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_COREPACK=1 in Vercel to use the pinned pnpm version.
# Never set CONTENT_TEST in a Vercel environment.
